OL,3,GNEWSAEpstein statue removed from city
OL,4,Acentre for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statue dedicated to The Beatles'
OL,7,Fformer manager in Liverpool city centre
OL,8,Fis to be removed temporarily for
OL,9,Fessential repairs.
OL,11,FHundreds of people gathered back in
OL,12,F2022 for the unveiling of the monument
OL,13,Fdedicated to the late Brian Epstein.
OL,15,FEpstein, often referred to as the fifth
OL,16,Fmember of the group, became The
OL,17,FBeatles' manager in 1961 after seeing
OL,18,Fthem play in the Cavern Club.
